<title>BRAZIL: Brazil bolsa suspends Belgo trade.</title>
<headline>Brazil bolsa suspends Belgo trade.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's bolsa suspended trading of Brazilian steelmaker Belgo-Mineira shares following a request by the company, a spokeswoman for the Sao Paulo stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Earlier today, Belgo-Mineira requested the bourse to halt trading of its shares because it would announce the purchase of a stake in Brazilian steelmaker  Acominas.</p>
<p>((--Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
